{
  "id": "E365",
  "title": "Horse Riding Diet",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-09-29",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s mom is planning to lose weight. Will she succeed?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1163/39d9f130483a2ce499a89aed472ef32e93c13d49.mp3?1569234994",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "骑马减肥\n\n小明的妈妈：我太胖了，我想减肥。\n小明的爸爸：那你去学骑马吧，又可以减肥，又有意思。\n小明的妈妈：你说得对，那我就去学骑马吧！\n（一个月后）\n小明的爸爸：你减肥减得怎么样了？\n小明的妈妈：瘦了20公斤。\n小明的爸爸：是吗？可是你看起来一点也没瘦啊。\n小明的妈妈：我是说马瘦了。",
    "traditional": "騎馬減肥\n\n小明的媽媽：我太胖了，我想減肥。\n小明的爸爸：那你去學騎馬吧，又可以減肥，又有意思。\n小明的媽媽：你說得對，那我就去學騎馬吧！\n（一個月後）\n小明的爸爸：你減肥減得怎麼樣了？\n小明的媽媽：瘦了20公斤。\n小明的爸爸：是嗎？可是你看起來一點也沒瘦啊。\n小明的媽媽：我是說馬瘦了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Horse Riding Diet"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：我太胖了，我想减肥。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：我太胖了，我想減肥。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wǒ tài pàng le wǒ xiǎng jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mother: I am too fat, I want to lose weight."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：那你去学骑马吧，又可以减肥，又有意思。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：那你去學騎馬吧，又可以減肥，又有意思。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba nà nǐ qù xué qí mǎ ba yòu kě yǐ jiǎn féi yòu yǒu yì si",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s father: Then you can go learn horseback riding. You can lose weight, and it is also interesting."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：你说得对，那我就去学骑马吧！",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：你說得對，那我就去學騎馬吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma nǐ shuō de duì nà wǒ jiù qù xué qí mǎ ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mother: You’re right, then I’ll learn horseback riding!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "（一个月后）",
      "traditional": "（一個月後）",
      "pinyin": "yí ge yuè hòu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "(A month later)"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：你减肥减得怎么样了？",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：你減肥減得怎麼樣了？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba nǐ jiǎn féi jiǎn de zěn me yàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s father: How’s your weight loss going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：瘦了20公斤。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：瘦了20公斤。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma shòu le 2 gōng jīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s mother: Lost 20 kg."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明的爸爸：是吗？可是你看起来一点也没瘦啊。",
      "traditional": "小明的爸爸：是嗎？可是你看起來一點也沒瘦啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de bà ba shì ma kě shì nǐ kàn qǐ lái yì diǎn yě méi shòu a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming’s father: Really? But you don’t look slimmer at all."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小明的妈妈：我是说马瘦了。",
      "traditional": "小明的媽媽：我是說馬瘦了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng de mā ma wǒ shì shuō mǎ shòu le",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
